# Cylon-inspired audition using only original SAM voice controls.
# Run from the repository root: build/robot-sam --console < demos/cylon-sam.commands
# Output: speech-001.wav in the current directory.
CHARACTER CLASSIC
SET PITCH 100
SET SPEED 90
SET MOUTH 110
SET THROAT 170
SET SING 1
SAY By your command. All systems are operational. You cannot escape. The fleet will be destroyed.
QUIT
